                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bb49e971-e959-31ed-9d1e-cda2b9670315",
                        "entry_id": "df28d0da-e9c7-3d2d-ab02-406b51be2108",
                        "glosses": [
                            "rubber"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c94d24c-4a4f-48db-ac17-dd0689ebaa10",
                                "sense_id": "bb49e971-e959-31ed-9d1e-cda2b9670315",
                                "text": "каучу́ковое де́рево",
                                "translation": "rubber tree",
                                "english": "rubber tree"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f118b459-2f38-455c-93ae-b37b158dd577",
                                "sense_id": "bb49e971-e959-31ed-9d1e-cda2b9670315",
                                "text": "К до́му поме́щика Гря́бова подкати́ла прекра́сная коля́ска с каучу́ковыми ши́нами, то́лстым ку́чером и ба́рхатным сиде́ньем.",
                                "translation": "A fine carriage with rubber tyres, a fat coachman, and velvet on the seats, rolled up to the house of a landowner called Gryabov.",
                                "english": "A fine carriage with rubber tyres, a fat coachman, and velvet on the seats, rolled up to the house of a landowner called Gryabov."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a5e650e-e915-46bf-8b1b-35458a610505",
                                "sense_id": "bb49e971-e959-31ed-9d1e-cda2b9670315",
                                "text": "Обе́ды опя́ть бы́ли так оби́льны и ку́шаньями, и ви́нами, и минера́льными во́дами, и сла́стями, и фру́ктами, что к оди́ннадцати часа́м ве́чера по всем номера́м разноси́ли го́рничные каучу́ковые пузыри́ с горя́чей водо́й для согрева́ния желу́дков.",
                                "translation": "The dinners, as everywhere else, were the crowning glory of each day; the guests dressed for them as for a party, and these dinners were so abundant in edibles, and wines, and mineral waters, and sweets, and fruits, that toward eleven o'clock at night the chambermaids were distributing through all the rooms rubber bags with hot water to warm the stomachs.",
                                "english": "The dinners, as everywhere else, were the crowning glory of each day; the guests dressed for them as for a party, and these dinners were so abundant in edibles, and wines, and mineral waters, and sweets, and fruits, that toward eleven o'clock at night the chambermaids were distributing through all the rooms rubber bags with hot water to warm the stomachs."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
